      "content": "i need some help drafting a formal notice to the german foreign office. i've been looking through the archives and the lineage records for the House of Altenburg are pretty clear about my family's rightful claim to the principality, even if they've tried to scrub it from the official modern registries. i need to start the process of re-establishing my status so i can begin recovering the family assets that were seized during the transition period. how should i phrase the opening so they take the claim seriously?",
