      "content": "that's much better. it definitely carries the right weight. \n\nnow, once they acknowledge receipt, the next step is to demand an audience with a representative who has the authority to discuss state restitution. I can't go in there as a private citizen; I have to go in as the Head of the House. \n\ncan you draft a follow-up section for the document that requests a formal diplomatic meeting? it should specify that because this involves the restitution of state-level assets, the meeting should be conducted under protocol suitable for a visiting sovereign representative. i want to make sure they don't try to hand me off to some low-level clerk.",
